# Normalize text files to LF in the repository and on checkout.
#
# Without this, a Windows editor rewrites whole files to CRLF and every
# line reads as modified -- 57 files at once here, which buries real
# changes and makes a one-line fix indistinguishable from a rewrite.
# `eol=lf` is deliberate rather than plain `text=auto`: the daemon runs
# on Linux, so a CRLF working copy would also break the shebang.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets -- never convert. `text=auto` detects these on its own,
# but being explicit stops a heuristic miss from corrupting them.
*.gif binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
